  "metadata": {
    "title": "NLP works through a stack of language layers",
    "description": "The NLP stack moves from tokenization through morphology, syntax, semantics, pragmatics, and discourse. The sentence \u201cI saw a girl with a telescope\u201d has two syntactic attachments: the speaker used the telescope or the girl had it."
